# The seed knows none of `__Raw.osDebugHost`, `__Raw.dbgEnvironmentValue`, `__Raw.dbgAttachSegment`,
# `__Raw.dbgCtlAddr`, `__Raw.dbgTextBase`, `__Raw.dbgTextLimit`, `__Raw.dbgServiceEntryAddr`,
# `__Raw.osThreadCreate`, `__Raw.schedTlsTebOffsetAddr`, `__Raw.schedAllMachinesAddr`,
# `__Raw.schedPreemptExtLockAddr` or `__Raw.schedLockAddr`, so it refuses `runtime/DebugAgent.maxon` at the
# first call to one (E3004). Every table that TEACHES those rows — `RawIntrinsics`, `StdDialect`, the x64
# lowering, the `IatSlot` band, `TargetFacilities` — is left standing, so `C1` knows them and compiles the
# unshimmed tree into `C2`.
#
# The tier file keeps every constant `checkDebugAgentGeometry` pins and every entry point the roots name;
# only the twelve rows are swapped for rows the seed already has, which makes each body inert rather than
# absent.
